losed_issues":2336,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:21:32Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":9,"created_at":"2026-10-09T20:59:40Z","updated_at":"2026-10-14T02:58:22Z","closed_at":"2026-10-14T02:58:19Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124338","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124338","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124338.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124338.patch","merged_at":"2026-10-14T02:58:19Z"},"body":"<!--\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\n\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\n\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\n-->\n\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\n\n- Closes #124330\n- Closes #124331 \n- Closes #124335 \n\n## Additional information\n\n<!--\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/contribution_rules.html#explain-your-contributions\n-->\n\nFixes regressions from #122510 in the Snap Menus from both 2D and 3D editors.\n\n2D:\ncanvas_item_editor_plugin.cpp::3092\n```\ncase SNAP_USE_NODE_PARENT: {\n\t\t\tint snap_mode = ci_manipulator->get_snap_mode() ^ CanvasItemManipulator::SNAP_NODE_PARENT;\n\t\t\tci_manipulator->set_snap_mode(snap_mode);\n\t\t\tint idx = smartsnap_config_popup->get_item_index(SNAP_USE_NODE_PARENT);\n\t\t\tsmartsnap_config_popup->set_item_checked(idx, snap_mode & CanvasItemManipulator::SNAP_NODE_PARENT);\n\t\t} break;\n\t\tcase SNAP_USE_NODE_ANCHORS: {\n\t\t\tint snap_mode = ci_manipulator->get_snap_mode() ^ CanvasItemManipulator::SNAP_NODE_ANCHORS;\n\t\t\tci_manipulator->set_snap_mode(snap_mode);\n\t\t\tint idx = smartsnap_config_popup->get_item_index(SNAP_USE_NODE_ANCHORS);\n\t\t\tsmartsnap_config_popup->set_item_checked(idx, snap_mode & CanvasItemManipulator::SNAP_NODE_ANCHORS);\n\t\t}\n```\nAfter the refactor it was introduced the CanvasItemManipulator class that would handle the setting of snap modes, however the line` ci_manipulator->set_snap_mode(snap_mode);` was omitted in most cases when handling the menu clicks, making those buttons to never change the value they had to change.\n\nI also found and fixed some faulty state loading when first opening the editor and a type, it was fixed with a proper bitwise operation that would handle the setting on and off of values, also corrected the typo from bool to int.\n\n3D:\n\nThe refactor moved the snap selectors from Transform Menu to a new Snap Menu, however it didnt change the calls from `transform_menu->` to `snap_menu->`, making the code think that the selectors were owned and called by a menu that no longer held them. Fixed that.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124338/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124338/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}